		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Plasticine, neon-blue otherworldly beasts that resemble a dog-sized, rubbery lion with tendrils instead of a mane. Profoundly deaf and capable of hibernating for centuries.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 4, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +0 (1d4 + void disease), <strong>MV</strong> near (climb), <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 1</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Saltwater Vulnerability</strong>. Avoids salt water. A flask of saltwater does 4d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Void Disease</strong>. CON 9+ or 1d4 DEX damage (can't heal while ill). Repeat check once per day; ends on success. Die at 0 DEX, spawns a void zombie 2d4 rounds later.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
